{"id":"d0867e168446dcbb","bookSlug":"robot-textbook","relPath":"section_11/section_11.md","title":"第11章 综合实战与测试验证","sections":["正文"],"excerpt":"整机联调是将机械、硬件、嵌入式软件、运动控制、感知、导航、任务系统等全部模块集成为一个可运行整体，并验证各模块协同工作的过程。对于轮腿式安保巡逻机器人，联调重点在于轮腿复合运动的稳定性和多系统数据流的正确性。","order":12,"previousId":"041e7a1c7693c617","nextId":"ad44325bf8e14324","html":"<h1 id=\"11\">第11章 综合实战与测试验证</h1>\n<h2 id=\"111\">11.1 整机联调流程</h2>\n<p>整机联调是将机械、硬件、嵌入式软件、运动控制、感知、导航、任务系统等全部模块集成为一个可运行整体，并验证各模块协同工作的过程。对于轮腿式安保巡逻机器人，联调重点在于轮腿复合运动的稳定性和多系统数据流的正确性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"1111\">11.1.1 联调准备</h3>\n<p>在开始整机联调前，需完成以下准备工作：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">项目</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">要求</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">检查方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">机械装配</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">所有螺栓紧固，关节转动灵活，线缆无干涉</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">手动转动关节，目视检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">硬件供电</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">各电压输出正常，电池电量充足</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">万用表测量各测试点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">底层固件</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">已烧录最新版本，CAN通信正常</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">USB-CAN工具收发测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">安全装置</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">急停开关有效，安全支架就绪</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">按下急停测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">测试场地</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">平整地面，周围无障碍，软垫防护</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">目视</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"1112\">11.1.2 分系统联调</h3>\n<p>整机联调前，应先进行分系统联调，确保每个子系统独立工作正常。</p>\n<p><strong>机械与驱动联调</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>空载状态下，逐个转动髋、膝关节，确认无卡滞、无异响。</li>\n<li>轮毂电机通电低速旋转，确认转向和编码器反馈正确。</li>\n<li>测试电磁制动器，断电抱闸、通电释放。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>底层控制联调</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>发送速度指令，确认轮毂电机响应。</li>\n<li>发送关节角度指令，确认关节电机到达目标位置。</li>\n<li>检查IMU数据，确认姿态角解算正确。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>感知系统联调</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>启动激光雷达和深度相机，确认数据发布。</li>\n<li>在Rviz中查看点云和图像，确认无异常。</li>\n<li>测试超声波传感器，确认距离数据合理。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>导航系统联调</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>加载已有地图，运行AMCL定位。</li>\n<li>在Rviz中给定目标点，确认全局路径规划成功。</li>\n<li>启动局部规划器，确认避障行为正常。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>任务系统联调</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>下发一个简单的定点巡逻任务，确认任务状态流转正常。</li>\n<li>模拟异常事件，确认报警和处理逻辑正确。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"1113\">11.1.3 整机联调步骤</h3>\n<p>分系统联调通过后，进行整机联调。整机联调遵循“先空载后负载、先静后动、先慢后快”的原则。</p>\n<p><strong>步骤1：空载上电自检</strong></p>\n<p>机器人置于安全支架上，上电启动所有系统。观察各节点启动状态，确认无报错。检查<code>/robot_state</code>话题，数据应正常发布。</p>\n<p><strong>步骤2：静态平衡测试</strong></p>\n<p>撤去安全支架，机器人落地。发送站立指令，观察机器人是否能稳定站立。轻微推动，观察平衡恢复能力。此时轮子可以锁死或处于速度环。</p>\n<p><strong>步骤3：低速轮式移动</strong></p>\n<p>发送低速前进指令（0.2 m/s），观察机器人是否能直线行驶。然后测试差速转向（0.3 rad/s），观察转向是否平滑。逐步提高速度至1.0 m/s。</p>\n<p><strong>步骤4：腿式动作测试</strong></p>\n<p>切换至腿式模式，执行蹲起动作。观察关节轨迹和身体高度变化。然后执行原地踏步（轮流抬腿），确认步态稳定。</p>\n<p><strong>步骤5：越障功能测试</strong></p>\n<p>在平坦地面放置一个50 mm高的台阶，让机器人以0.3 m/s接近，触发腿式越障。观察越障动作是否连贯、稳定。</p>\n<p><strong>步骤6：自主导航测试</strong></p>\n<p>加载地图，发送目标点，让机器人自主导航。在路径中放置动态障碍物，观察避障行为。导航过程中注意定位精度和路径跟踪。</p>\n<p><strong>步骤7：完整任务闭环</strong></p>\n<p>下发巡逻任务，包含多个路径点和一次越障区域。观察机器人是否按计划完成巡逻并返回。</p>\n<p>整机联调中常见问题及处理：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">问题</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">可能原因</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">处理方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">机器人无法站立</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">平衡控制器参数不正确、IMU零偏未校准</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">重新标定IMU，调整LQR增益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">轮式移动抖动</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">速度环增益过大、编码器噪声</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">降低速度环Kp，滤波编码器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">转向过度/不足</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">差速解算错误、轮径不一致</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">校准轮径，修正轮距参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">越障时摔倒</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">步态轨迹不合理、重心超出支撑域</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">调整步态参数，降低抬腿高度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">导航定位丢失</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">激光雷达被遮挡、AMCL粒子发散</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">清洁雷达，重新设置初始位姿</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"112\">11.2 可视化监控界面设计</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1121\">11.2.1 界面布局</h3>\n<p>监控界面采用三栏布局：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>左侧</strong>：视频显示和报警列表。</li>\n<li><strong>中间</strong>：地图显示机器人位置和巡逻轨迹。</li>\n<li><strong>右侧</strong>：状态面板（电量、模式、速度等）和遥控按钮。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"1122\">11.2.2 状态面板实现</h3>\n<p>状态面板订阅<code>/robot_state</code>话题，解析并显示。机器人状态数据打包为<code>Float32MultiArray</code>，字段顺序为：俯仰角、髋关节角、轮速、故障码、电池电压、电流、模式等（定义于第5章）。</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">statusListener</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ow\">new</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">ROSLIB</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">Topic</span><span class=\"p\">({</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nx\">ros</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">ros</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nx\">name</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;/robot_state&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nx\">messageType</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;std_msgs/Float32MultiArray&#39;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">});</span>\n\n<span class=\"nx\">statusListener</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">subscribe</span><span class=\"p\">((</span><span class=\"nx\">msg</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kd\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">data</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">msg</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">data</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nb\">document</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">getElementById</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;pitch&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"nx\">innerText</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]).</span><span class=\"nx\">toFixed</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">&#39; rad&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nb\">document</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">getElementById</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;hip_angle&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"nx\">innerText</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]).</span><span class=\"nx\">toFixed</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">&#39; rad&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nb\">document</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">getElementById</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;wheel_speed&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"nx\">innerText</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">2</span><span class=\"p\">]).</span><span class=\"nx\">toFixed</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">&#39; rpm&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kd\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">fault</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">3</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nb\">document</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">getElementById</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;fault_code&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"nx\">innerText</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">fault</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"c1\">// 如果后续有电压电流，继续解析</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"c1\">// ...</span>\n<span class=\"p\">});</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"1123\">11.2.3 地图显示</h3>\n<p>地图使用ros2djs（或nav2djs）加载栅格地图，并标记机器人位置。也可使用静态地图图片配合CSS定位。简化方案：订阅/amcl_pose话题，将机器人坐标映射到地图图片上的像素点。</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\">// 订阅AMCL定位</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">poseListener</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ow\">new</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">ROSLIB</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">Topic</span><span class=\"p\">({</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nx\">ros</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">ros</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nx\">name</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;/amcl_pose&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nx\">messageType</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;geometry_msgs/PoseWithCovarianceStamped&#39;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">});</span>\n\n<span class=\"nx\">poseListener</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">subscribe</span><span class=\"p\">((</span><span class=\"nx\">msg</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kd\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">msg</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">pose</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">pose</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">position</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">x</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kd\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">msg</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">pose</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">pose</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">position</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">y</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"c1\">// 地图分辨率0.05m/pixel，原点在左下角</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kd\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">pixelX</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.05</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kd\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">pixelY</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">mapHeight</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.05</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nx\">updateRobotMarker</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">pixelX</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">pixelY</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">});</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"1124\">11.2.4 报警提示</h3>\n<p>订阅/anomaly_events话题，收到报警后弹出提示并显示现场图像（如果消息中包含图像或通过独立话题获取）。</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">anomalyListener</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ow\">new</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">ROSLIB</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">Topic</span><span class=\"p\">({</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nx\">ros</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">ros</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nx\">name</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;/anomaly_events&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nx\">messageType</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;std_msgs/String&#39;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">});</span>\n\n<span class=\"nx\">anomalyListener</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">subscribe</span><span class=\"p\">((</span><span class=\"nx\">msg</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kd\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">JSON</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">parse</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">msg</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">data</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nx\">alert</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sb\">`异常事件：</span><span class=\"si\">${</span><span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">type</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"sb\">，等级：</span><span class=\"si\">${</span><span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">severity</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"sb\">`</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"c1\">// 请求现场图像</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nx\">fetchSnapshot</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"p\">});</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"1125\">11.2.5 遥控按钮</h3>\n<p>在遥控模式下，通过按钮发送/cmd_vel指令。按钮按下时发送固定速度，松开时发送零速度。</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">button</span> <span class=\"na\">onmousedown</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">&quot;sendVelocity(0.5, 0)&quot;</span> <span class=\"na\">onmouseup</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">&quot;sendVelocity(0, 0)&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>前进<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">button</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">button</span> <span class=\"na\">onmousedown</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">&quot;sendVelocity(-0.5, 0)&quot;</span> <span class=\"na\">onmouseup</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">&quot;sendVelocity(0, 0)&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>后退<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">button</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">button</span> <span class=\"na\">onmousedown</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">&quot;sendVelocity(0, 1.0)&quot;</span> <span class=\"na\">onmouseup</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">&quot;sendVelocity(0, 0)&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>左转<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">button</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">button</span> <span class=\"na\">onmousedown</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">&quot;sendVelocity(0, -1.0)&quot;</span> <span class=\"na\">onmouseup</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">&quot;sendVelocity(0, 0)&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>右转<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">button</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"113\">11.3 故障诊断与维修</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1131\">11.3.1 常见故障分类</h3>\n<p>根据故障来源，将常见故障分为机械、电气、软件三类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">类别</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">典型故障</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">机械</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">关节轴承磨损、螺栓松动、轮胎磨损</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">关节晃动、异响、跑偏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">电气</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">电机驱动损坏、电源故障、传感器失灵</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">电机不转、系统重启、数据异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">软件</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">控制参数错误、通信超时、内存溢出</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">运动异常、节点崩溃、系统卡顿</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"1132\">11.3.2 诊断流程</h3>\n<p>故障诊断遵循“先软后硬、先简后繁”的原则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>现象记录</strong>：记录故障发生时的运行状态、环境条件、操作步骤。</li>\n<li><strong>日志分析</strong>：查看ROS日志（<code>rosout.log</code>）、底层故障码、数据库记录。</li>\n<li><strong>分系统隔离</strong>：逐一关闭或断开非必要模块，缩小故障范围。</li>\n<li><strong>硬件检测</strong>：使用万用表、示波器、逻辑分析仪检测硬件信号。</li>\n<li><strong>软件调试</strong>：使用<code>rostopic echo</code>、<code>rqt</code>、GDB等工具定位软件问题。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"1133\">11.3.3 维修与更换</h3>\n<p>对于诊断出的故障，进行维修或更换部件：</p>\n<p><strong>机械维修</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>螺栓松动：按扭矩复紧。</li>\n<li>轴承磨损：更换同型号轴承。</li>\n<li>轮胎磨损：更换轮胎或整个轮毂电机轮。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>电气维修</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>驱动芯片损坏：更换MOS管或驱动芯片。</li>\n<li>电源模块故障：更换DC-DC模块。</li>\n<li>传感器损坏：更换传感器并重新标定。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>软件修复</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>参数错误：调整PID/LQR参数，重新标定。</li>\n<li>代码缺陷：修复代码后重新编译部署。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>维修后需进行功能验证，确保故障消除且未引入新问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"114\">11.4 现场部署与运维</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1141\">11.4.1 部署前准备</h3>\n<p>现场部署前需完成以下工作：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">项目</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">现场勘察</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">了解巡逻区域地形、网络覆盖、光照条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">地图构建</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">使用机器人在现场建图，保存高精度地图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">路径规划</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">根据巡逻需求设置路径点和禁入区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">网络配置</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">配置Wi-Fi/4G，确保远程监控可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">安全评估</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">识别可能造成机器人损坏或伤人的风险点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"1142\">11.4.2 现场部署流程</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>机器人运输</strong>：将机器人运至现场，注意防震、防潮。</li>\n<li><strong>上电自检</strong>：开机运行自检程序，确认各系统正常。</li>\n<li><strong>初始定位</strong>：在已知起点启动AMCL，确认定位成功。</li>\n<li><strong>试运行</strong>：进行短距离自主导航测试，观察避障和越障。</li>\n<li><strong>任务下发</strong>：通过远程监控端下发巡逻任务。</li>\n<li><strong>监控与调整</strong>：在监控端观察运行状态，根据实际调整参数。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"1143\">11.4.3 运维管理</h3>\n<p>日常运维包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>每日检查</strong>：检查轮胎气压、螺栓紧固、电池电量。</li>\n<li><strong>每周维护</strong>：清洁传感器镜头，检查线缆连接。</li>\n<li><strong>每月保养</strong>：关节润滑、电池容量检测、软件日志清理。</li>\n<li><strong>故障处理</strong>：按11.4节流程快速诊断和维修。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>建立运维记录表，记录每次维护和故障处理情况，便于追踪和改进。</p>\n<h2 id=\"115\">11.5 实战：从样机到巡逻任务完整闭环</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1151\">11.5.1 任务目标</h3>\n<p>在本实战中，读者将把前面所有章节的工作整合起来，完成从一台散件样机到执行实际巡逻任务的完整闭环。任务包括：装配、上电、调试、建图、部署、巡逻、评估。</p>\n<h3 id=\"1152\">11.5.2 实施步骤</h3>\n<p><strong>阶段一：样机准备</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>完成机械装配（第3章），确保所有部件安装到位。</li>\n<li>完成硬件接线（第4章），上电测试各电压。</li>\n<li>烧录底层固件（第5章），验证CAN通信和电机控制。</li>\n<li>启动上层软件，检查ROS节点和话题。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>阶段二：功能验证</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>验证轮式模式移动和转向（第7章）。</li>\n<li>验证腿式模式越障和蹲起（第7章）。</li>\n<li>验证环境感知和目标检测（第8章）。</li>\n<li>验证自主导航和避障（第9章）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>阶段三：场景部署</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在目标园区进行建图，保存地图。</li>\n<li>设置巡逻路径点和禁区。</li>\n<li>配置远程监控终端（第10章）。</li>\n<li>进行试运行，调整参数。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>阶段四：任务执行与评估</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>下发正式巡逻任务，运行至少2小时。</li>\n<li>记录巡逻轨迹、报警事件、电量消耗。</li>\n<li>统计路径点到达率、报警准确率、续航时间。</li>\n<li>撰写测试报告，总结问题和改进建议。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"1153\">11.5.3 结果评估</h3>\n<p>评估标准如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">评估项</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">目标</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">实测</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">结论</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">路径点到达率</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">≥95%</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">报警准确率</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">≥90%</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">续航时间</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">≥1.5 h</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">故障次数</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">≤1次</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">远程监控可用性</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">100%</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>完成本实战后，读者将具备从零开始设计、搭建、部署一台轮腿式智能安保巡逻机器人并执行实际任务的能力，标志着本书全部学习目标的达成。</p>\n<hr>\n<p>通过本章的整机联调、性能测试、可靠性验证、故障诊断和现场部署，读者应能掌握机器人从实验室样机走向实际应用的全流程工程方法。轮腿式机器人的开发是一个不断迭代、优化和验证的过程，希望读者在实践中积累经验，持续改进自己的平台。</p>","headings":[{"level":2,"id":"111","text":"11.1 整机联调流程"},{"level":3,"id":"1111","text":"11.1.1 联调准备"},{"level":3,"id":"1112","text":"11.1.2 分系统联调"},{"level":3,"id":"1113","text":"11.1.3 整机联调步骤"},{"level":2,"id":"112","text":"11.2 可视化监控界面设计"},{"level":3,"id":"1121","text":"11.2.1 界面布局"},{"level":3,"id":"1122","text":"11.2.2 状态面板实现"},{"level":3,"id":"1123","text":"11.2.3 地图显示"},{"level":3,"id":"1124","text":"11.2.4 报警提示"},{"level":3,"id":"1125","text":"11.2.5 遥控按钮"},{"level":2,"id":"113","text":"11.3 故障诊断与维修"},{"level":3,"id":"1131","text":"11.3.1 常见故障分类"},{"level":3,"id":"1132","text":"11.3.2 诊断流程"},{"level":3,"id":"1133","text":"11.3.3 维修与更换"},{"level":2,"id":"114","text":"11.4 现场部署与运维"},{"level":3,"id":"1141","text":"11.4.1 部署前准备"},{"level":3,"id":"1142","text":"11.4.2 现场部署流程"},{"level":3,"id":"1143","text":"11.4.3 运维管理"},{"level":2,"id":"115","text":"11.5 实战：从样机到巡逻任务完整闭环"},{"level":3,"id":"1151","text":"11.5.1 任务目标"},{"level":3,"id":"1152","text":"11.5.2 实施步骤"},{"level":3,"id":"1153","text":"11.5.3 结果评估"}]}